OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FWhen Rikki Stein first heard Fela
OL,10,     FKuti's music he was in the back of
OL,11,     Fa car and felt awestruck. Just a
OL,12,     Ffew years later Rikki was managing
OL,13,     FFela and the pair had become close
OL,14,     Ffriends.
OL,15,G0350 Witness History
OL,16,     FIn 1997, scientists set out to
OL,17,     Ffind a cave in Tsavo, Kenya,
OL,18,     Fbelieved to have once been the den
OL,19,     Fof the man-eating lions that
OL,20,     Fterrorised Indian and African
OL,21,     Frailway workers in 1898.
